                                                                                    <p>I will ensure that my webcam will be switched on and audio settings is done before the start of the meeting. I will not use Audio Splitter or speaker for voice communication.</p>
                                                                                    <p>I will not appear for the interview using mobile or tablet.</p>
                                                                                    <p>I will ensure to use Chrome (preferably) and download zoom plugin. I will join the meeting by clicking on the meeting link using my laptop.</p>
                                                                                    <p>I will share my desktop during the interview and will have my desktop and browser clean and close all the apps before the start of the interview.</p>
                                                                                    <p>I will not be late for my scheduled interview, and will join 5 minutes before time.</p>
                                                                                    <p>I will ensure that I will be in the silent place where there is no background noise and with appropriate light during the interview. If required I will choose a clean uncluttered background.</p>
                                                                                    <p>I am aware that this will be a hands-on interview, so I will have the editor open.</p>
